            "languageId": "19",
            "title": "Needle contact",
            "contentJson": [
                {
                    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">The Hep B in one person’s blood can pass to another person through sharing needles or if you stab yourself with a used needle. Although Hep B needs to live in a person to survive for a long time it can stay alive for about a week outside the body.</span><br><br></p><p><a href=\"\" data-url=\"https://bmcpublichealth.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/1471-2458-14-1233\"><em>Davies et al. (2014),</em></a><a href=\"\" data-url=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/278042538_Development_of_a_Culturally_Appropriate_Bilingual_Electronic_App_About_Hepatitis_B_for_Indigenous_Australians_Towards_Shared_Understandings\"><em> Davies et al. (2015)</em></a></p>"
                }
            ],
            "audioPath": "/uploads/2026/0520/fd491a016ec74c63afddad9260a11958.mp3",
            "videoPath": "",
            "photoPaths": [
                {
                    "path": "/uploads/2026/0520/b528b1269cc84ab19212b3054b0cb63c.png"
                }
            ],
            "autoNext": 90,
            "id": "91"
        },
        {
            "languageId": "30",
            "title": "Needles",
            "contentJson": [
                {
                    "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">Warrayn jabugij-maji mana wulang ama-garrajang yagu numbu-lhaganmaynjang maji ngarra needle mirri marri ba-dhugiyn maji warra-wurruj-maji abiyn ana wudhangurrg ngiga-wiyninung marri niga-wiyn anadanu angu-lhangarrmang ana-wudhangurrg ba-dhugiyn maji ngarra needle mirri. Ngijang ana hep B angu-burra warra-wurruj-duj badag angu-wiri-wugij angu marangaynjabugij ngarra-alirr ana-lhirribala ngarra needle luj.</span></p><p></p><p></p><p><a href=\"\" data-url=\"https://bmcpublichealth.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/1471-2458-14-1233\"><em>Davies et al. (2014),</em></a><a href=\"\" data-url=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/278042538_Development_of_a_Culturally_Appropriate_Bilingual_Electronic_App_About_Hepatitis_B_for_Indigenous_Australians_Towards_Shared_Understandings\"><em> Davies et al. (2015)</em></a></p>"
                }
            ],
            "audioPath": "/uploads/2026/0526/7ce70d315564474897e6f13879ad3f71.mp3",
            "videoPath": "",
            "photoPaths": [
                {
                    "path": "/uploads/2026/0526/ff0151ea6c8d4ac5b79ab84376528ff6.png"
