            "id": "92"
        },
        {
            "languageId": "29",
            "title": "Gajimbat Hep B from she-she nidul",
            "contentJson": [
                {
                    "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">Sambodi gada Hep B gin gibit yu dat bairis if yunbala she-she mijal wanbala nidul. En yu gin gajim Hep B if yu misteik jalk mijal garra nidul det naja sambodi bin olredi yusum. Dat Hep B bairis gin jidan laibwan insaid la nidul ba wan wik.</span><br><br><a href=\"\" data-url=\"https://bmcpublichealth.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/1471-2458-14-1233\"><em>Davies et al. (2014),</em></a><a href=\"\" data-url=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/278042538_Development_of_a_Culturally_Appropriate_Bilingual_Electronic_App_About_Hepatitis_B_for_Indigenous_Australians_Towards_Shared_Understandings\"><em> Davies et al. (2015)</em></a></p>"
                }
            ],
            "audioPath": "/uploads/2026/0526/72d01dd11a0841ea8a79db78b1348bd8.mp3",
            "videoPath": "",
            "photoPaths": [
                {
                    "path": "/uploads/2026/0526/14af11ebb29248a49283c70c5361ba3f.png"
                }
            ],
            "autoNext": 90,
            "id": "93"
        },
        {
            "languageId": "28",
            "title": "Gun-guna janguny gu-werranga ny-ma minypa Hep B Gu-gaya barra hep-b minypa gerdada gu-buma barra, minypa n-ma Hep B",
            "contentJson": [
                {
                    "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">Gun—guna Hep B an-ngardipa an-gugaliya abarr-wuchichiya nadal gu-derda gubirr-ma minypa nadal aburr-wuchichiya. Nipa gun-gata wanngu guyu minypa ana-gala gun-gata giyinda yalanga gun-gata guyurra arr-gala rrapa arr-maliyirra jarkjin ana-giyinda.</span><br><br><a href=\"\" data-url=\"https://bmcpublichealth.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/1471-2458-14-1233\"><em>Davies et al. (2014),</em></a><a href=\"\" data-url=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/278042538_Development_of_a_Culturally_Appropriate_Bilingual_Electronic_App_About_Hepatitis_B_for_Indigenous_Australians_Towards_Shared_Understandings\"><em> Davies et al. (2015)</em></a></p>"
                }
            ],
